-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----
DVS_PLACEHOLDER_PRIVATE_KEY_REPLACE_IN_CI
Non-production placeholder for the DVS (integration) L4 leaf private key.
Intentionally NOT a valid key. The build pipeline generates a fresh EC keypair
and replaces this file before publishing. Only the L4 leaf private key is ever
bundled; the CA private keys are never exposed.
-----END PRIVATE KEY-----
